[
  // Smithing's profession actions are the *feedstock* half: ore and scrap into ingots, and the
  // one forged component Artifice needs. The deep half — infusion, quenching, alloying with
  // intent, fabrication — is the Forge bench and the material transformation engine, which
  // already exist. Nothing here is a second crafting engine (docs/professions.md §8).
  // Smelt Iron lives in smelt_iron.json since the vertical slice.
  {
    "id": "action.smelt_copper",
    "professionId": "profession.smithing",
